{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\n      \"source\": \"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿连不平静究竟属于哪种情绪都拿不准，屏幕稿却预设了生气和想念两种情绪，只把不确定留给了对象。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"越亲切，越能感到它离眼前有多远\",\n      \"source\": \"温柔得让人心颤，也刺痛得让人绝望：越怀念，越能感觉它与眼前处境的距离。\",\n      \"type\": 4,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把产生距离感的缘由从越怀念改成越亲切，改变了原来的情感关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"screen\": \"越往前赶，思绪越盘旋，始终停不下来\",\n      \"source\": \"不停地往前赶，只是为了避免停下来。思绪就这样反复盘旋，试图想清楚，却始终无法停歇。\",\n      \"type\": 4,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把往前赶和思绪盘旋写成了递增的因果关系，定稿只是分别说明赶路是在逃避停下来、思绪则持续盘旋。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确限定为一种可选的心理解读，屏幕稿去掉条件和仿佛，变成确定的心理动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"screen\": \"害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这股推进听成人的处境，最动人的不是忽然变得无所畏惧，而是害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将人物处境作为一种有条件的音乐解读，屏幕稿去掉了这个前提，直接确定人物正处于这种状态。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "556d0dfa-cf47-4e32-92c9-59ec2447daf8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T191504325865Z", "elapsed_seconds": 445.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T19:22:29.347013+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8257f23031e11552cdb5f8443b3a0eebfe0d7abe7d1a54b3a6f0cb0f9bf945d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T191504325865Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "81063d7df7152911622d1fbf7d097c14d038079db1f6c30de6a23daba41f6462"}}}
